    <translations>
        <copyno><![CDATA[Instructions_body]]></copyno>
        <copy><![CDATA[The aim of the Where in the World game is to place the cities within the countries as fast as you can. There are 10 levels in total that get harder as you progress. 

When the timer starts, simply drag the cities into the correct empty squares on the map. When you have them correctly in place, click the proceed button. Hurry though! If the timer runs out then it’s game over.

Once you have gone as far as you can, you can post your score to facebook, view the leaderboard or try again.]]></copy>
